-- Taken from EcosystemSA on 2026-10-15: 692 entries = 675 startups
-- (17 startups are listed twice there; each second entry only fills gaps in the first). This file:
--   1. DELETES the 456 startups that are not on EcosystemSA (they came from other lists)
--   2. updates the 672 that are, with EcosystemSA's newer data: name, Arabic name,
--      website, stage, sector, region, tags, logo link and country
--   3. adds the 3 that were missing (ids ST_1129 and up)
-- Descriptions: EcosystemSA has few. Where it has one that differs from ours, it replaces
-- ours (in English and Arabic); everywhere else our English and Arabic descriptions stay.
-- Sectors, stages and regions are tidied the same way as seed/startups.sql.
-- Logos stay on EcosystemSA's servers: the logo column holds the image link.
-- Everything runs in one transaction: if any step fails, nothing changes.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------

